      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Who We Are",
        "body": "<p>Meet Experience (ME) is a digital marketing and technology solutions agency under <a href=\"https://www.meetsocial.com/\" title=\"https://www.meetsocial.com/\"><strong>Meetsocial Group</strong></a>. We help businesses establish and grow their digital presence through website development, search engine optimization (SEO), AI SEO and integrated digital marketing solutions.</p><p>Headquartered in Shanghai, China, ME serves businesses across Singapore, Southeast Asia and global markets. Combining global marketing experience, AI and MarTech capabilities, we connect digital strategy, technical implementation and ongoing operations to support businesses at every stage of digital growth.</p><p>Our services cover the complete digital growth journey — from building websites and improving search visibility to customer engagement, marketing automation, data analytics and cloud solutions.</p>",
